# Adopted H4 PR MC-variability supplement

The existing four figures, four CSV tables and PR-only report at commit `295b93d50662a0f8af3ec469df43099a3f04af60` are adopted for supplementary use. This packet links the same H4 P cohort to the existing manuscript without changing the main table or Figure 2.

- [Supplementary captions and figure/table links](supplementary_captions.md)
- [Supplementary Methods and interpretation limits](supplementary_methods.md)
- [Paper manifest with the adopted supplement](paper_manifest.json)
