- [Adopted supplementary claim overlay](claim_evidence_matrix_overlay.json)
- [Evidence ledger v4, retaining all prior records](evidence_ledger_v4.csv)
- [Claim–asset–ledger linkage](evidence_linkage.csv)
- [Figure/table asset registry](supplement_assets.csv)
