- [Original PR-only report](../../../../docs/research/track_a_h4_pr_cost_variability_20261019.md)
- [Integration summary](../../../../docs/research/track_a_h4_mc_supplement_20261019.md)

The accepted claims concern (1) PR mean-cost variation with MC sample size, (2) the approximate saved SE dependence on 1/√n, and (3) the observed S0/S2 association with full PR cost. No population/rare-support guarantee, new independent cohort, new statistics, detailed scientific review or final scientific evidence freeze is implied.
